&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the founding analytics engineer in Finance, shaping our data infrastructure and analytical capabilities during a critical transformation. Your expertise in Python, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DBT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, SQL, and Databricks will drive operational efficiency, accelerate our month-end close, and deliver strategic insights that inform capital allocation and IPO readiness. This is a greenfield opportunity to own the analytics roadmap, work directly with Finance leadership, and build infrastructure that powers both scaling and compliance, all at a pivotal moment for Mews&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you would do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop analytical features that surface actionable insights for Finance leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, optimise and maintain production-ready ETL/ELT pipelines using DBT, Databricks and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create scalable data models and analytical solutions using modern data modelling techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and champion data quality and testing practices; catch errors before they reach stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across Finance to translate business requirements into technical implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for modern data practices and continuous improvement of the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on production experience building and optimising ETL/ELT pipelines (minimum 3 years)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and Python; strong experience with DBT or equivalent modern data transformation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Databricks or similar cloud data platforms, or willingness to ramp quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data modelling and analytics architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working autonomously and managing priorities with ambiguity; ability to break down complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated commitment to data quality, testing and accuracy; take pride in work that&#39;s been thoroughly validated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualisation tools like Power BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working with regulated or governed data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling analytics in fast-growing startups or scale-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€46.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;867 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 598 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£49,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£55,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$54,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$65,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Black Duck Software, Inc. helps organizations build secure, high-quality software, minimizing risks while maximizing speed and productivity. Black Duck, a recognized pioneer in application security, provides SAST, SCA, and DAST solutions that enable teams to quickly find and fix vulnerabilities and defects in proprietary code, open source components, and application behavior. With a combination of industry-leading tools, services, and expertise, only Black Duck helps organizations maximize security and quality in DevSecOps and throughout the software development life cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager, Professional Services – EMEA, you will lead Black Duck&#39;s regional Professional Services team, responsible for helping customers successfully adopt and operationalize application security solutions. You will manage a team of Implementation Consultants who transform customer investments in Black Duck technology into measurable business and security outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines people leadership, customer engagement, operational management, and business partnership. You will work closely with Sales, Customer Success, Technical Account Managers, Product, Support, and Services leadership to ensure exceptional customer experiences while building a high-performing and scalable services organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this is a leadership position, it is not a purely managerial role. The successful candidate will remain actively engaged with customers, supporting strategic initiatives, executive relationships, complex delivery programmes, and critical business outcomes across the EMEA region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager, Professional Services – EMEA, you will play a critical role in helping customers realise the full value of Black Duck solutions while shaping the future of our services organisation across Europe, the Middle East, and Africa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a geographically distributed team of highly skilled services professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence customer success at some of the world&#39;s most recognised software-driven organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the onboarding and adoption experience for customers across the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders across Sales, Customer Success, Technical Account Managers, Product, Support, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help execute the regional services strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable delivery models that drive both customer outcomes and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead and Develop the EMEA Services Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, inspire, and develop a high-performing team of Implementation Consultants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop team members to achieve their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, collaboration, customer focus, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support career development and skills growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build regional capabilities aligned with evolving market and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, retain, and develop top consulting talent across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Deliver Exceptional Customer Outcomes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure customers achieve measurable value from their Black Duck investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee successful delivery of implementation, onboarding, advisory, and adoption services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistency in delivery methodology, quality standards, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with strategic customers and executive stakeholders to support complex programmes and critical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for significant delivery challenges and customer concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion customer success and long-term business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Drive Operational Excellence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the operational management of the Professional Services organisation across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage resource planning, utilisation, capacity forecasting, backlog management, and delivery performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable processes, methodologies, and delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key business metrics including service delivery performance, customer satisfaction, project health, and forecasting accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve efficiency, predictability, and service quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational improvements that enable the business to scale effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Partner Across the Business&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional leaders to drive customer success and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales teams to support strategic opportunities and services positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Success teams to accelerate customer adoption and time-to-value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Technical Account Managers to ensure seamless transitions from implementation to ongoing adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define customer engagement strategies for key accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide field insights to Product Management, Engineering, and Support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of new services offerings and go-to-market initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Act as a Trusted Customer Advisor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive-level relationships with strategic customers and help ensure successful outcomes throughout their journey with Black Duck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a leadership sponsor for key customer engagements when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate directly in customer meetings, business reviews, workshops, and strategic planning sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support critical customer situations and escalations while maintaining a focus on long-term partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the Professional Services organisation both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be visible and accessible to customers whenever leadership engagement is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Contribute to Business Growth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help grow Black Duck&#39;s services business and strengthen customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regional services bookings and revenue objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand customer engagement through onboarding, implementation, training, optimisation, and advisory services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to regional planning and organisational strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives that improve scalability and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a leader who combines technical credibility, business acumen, and a passion for helping teams and customers succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience managing Professional Services, Consulting, Customer Success, Technical Delivery, or Solutions organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading distributed teams across multiple countries and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer-facing experience, including executive stakeholder engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing services delivery operations, resource planning, forecasting, and capacity management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and operational management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, influencing, and leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technical and Industry Knowledge&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within cybersecurity, application security, DevSecOps, SaaS, or enterprise software organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of software development, secure development practices, DevOps, or related technology domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage credibly with both technical teams and senior business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting complex enterprise customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Helpful Experience, But Not Mandatory&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application security, SAST, SCA, DAST, IAST, software supply chain security, or related cybersecurity experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading Professional Services organisations through growth and organisational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security certifications or relevant industry credentials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be successful when:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your team consistently delivers high-quality projects and onboarding outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team members are engaged, growing, and recognised as trusted advisors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resource utilisation, backlog management, and delivery performance are healthy and predictable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built strong partnerships with Sales, Customer Success, and Technical Account Management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional teams view Professional Services as a strategic partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The EMEA services organisation scales effectively while maintaining quality and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers will see value when:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;They achieve measurable value from their Black Duck investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;They receive expert guidance throughout their implementation journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects are delivered efficiently and aligned to business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Their experience feels seamless across implementation, adoption, and ongoing success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;They experience a coordinated and customer-centric approach across Black Duck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;They receive a consistent experience regardless of geography or complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Practical Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Flexible within EMEA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel: Occasional travel within EMEA for customer visits, team engagement, leadership meetings, and company events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports To: Director of Professional Services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Scope: Responsible for leading the EMEA Professional Services organisation, including Implementation Consultants, while partnering closely with Customer Success and Technical Account Management teams to drive customer onboarding, adoption, and long-term success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;If This Sounds Like You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are passionate about developing people, building trusted customer relationships, and helping customers achieve business outcomes from technology investments. You enjoy balancing leadership, operational excellence, and customer engagement, and you are comfortable working across teams to drive customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited by the opportunity to help some of the world&#39;s leading organisations improve how they build secure software while leading a talented regional team, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Black Duck and help shape the future of application security services across EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Black Duck is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, sex, gender identity or expression, age, disability, sexual orientation, veteran or military service status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. Black Duck complies with all applicable laws prohibiting employment discrimination in every jurisdiction where it operates and provides reasonable accommodations to individuals with disabilities in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At OpenUp, we believe mental well-being should be as accessible and normal as going to the gym. Our mission is simple but ambitious: to make mental well-being available to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We partner with companies to support their employees and families through proactive, practical mental health services. Our platform brings together 1:1 check-ins, courses, content, group sessions, and mindfulness practices - all supported by a dedicated network of experts. We take a holistic view, connecting mental and physical well-being through lifestyle coaching focused on sleep, nutrition, and exercise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we support over 1,500 companies and 500,000+ employees globally, including Rituals, Deloitte, Decathlon, KPMG, and McDonald’s. Recognised as a Top 3 LinkedIn Startup in 2023, 2024 and 2025 - and we&#39;ve got big plans to keep growing our client-base, which is where this role comes into play.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re growing our presence in the DACH market and are looking for entrepreneurial, purpose-driven Account Executives to help build this market with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;In this role, you own the full sales cycle end-to-end - from identifying opportunities and opening conversations, through to closing deals and building long-term relationships. This is not a “plug-and-play” sales role; it’s an opportunity to shape how we grow in DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with our Business Development, Customer Success, and Marketing teams as part of a collaborative, international commercial team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new business by identifying and engaging potential clients across the DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and expand a strong network of B2B partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow existing accounts by spotting expansion opportunities (including international rollouts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted first point of contact for your customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You genuinely enjoy working with people; you’re energised by conversations, building relationships, and connecting with stakeholders at different levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You bring a combination of drive, curiosity, and resilience. You take ownership, learn from setbacks, and continuously look for ways to improve. You’re comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment and enjoy being part of a team that builds together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Mental well-being resonates with you as something that matters and something you want to contribute to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in sales (ideally B2B SaaS or high-growth environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building skills - you’re a natural, confident and engaging networker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience - or interest - in building a network within HR or People teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in closing deals with medium- to large-enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured, action-oriented way of working and a relationship-focussed sales approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for working in a highly dynamic, AI-forward international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools like Salesforce, HubSpot, or Pipedrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent language skills in both German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get as part of our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll join a company that combines commercial ambition with meaningful impact. We move fast, support each other, and make time to celebrate along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Alongside a competitive salary and bonus structure, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€1500 annual personal development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to your ClassPass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€50 monthly internet/phone allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily healthy, vegetarian lunch at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular yoga, meditation, and breathing sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid working model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly drinks, summer events, ski trips, and padel tournaments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27.5 vacation days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free and unlimited access to OpenUp for you and your family, including sessions with psychologists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired to be part of OpenUp? We’d love to hear your story. Apply via our website and we’ll get in touch soon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have questions, please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://openup.com/nl/veelgestelde-vragen/&quot;&gt;FAQ page&lt;/a&gt; or reach out directly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At OpenUp, everyone is welcome to apply regardless of age, gender, background, nationality, or any other characteristic. What matters to us is high performance, a real drive to make an impact and the ambition to become the European market leader. If you&#39;re ready to OpenUp, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to streamline parts of our recruitment process. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgement. All hiring decisions are made by humans. If you would like more information about how we use AI in the process, please contact us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;472&quot;&gt;The Payments team at&lt;strong&gt; Raisin Bank&lt;/strong&gt; ensures the secure, compliant, and efficient execution of all money movements across Europe. As part of a fully licensed bank, the team manages the end-to-end payment lifecycle, from customer transactions to partner settlements, supporting Raisin’s retail platform and B2B Banking-as-a-Service offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;474&quot; data-end=&quot;691&quot;&gt;By combining experienced payments experts with ambitious professionals, the team drives operational excellence while working closely with Product and Engineering to automate and continuously improve payment processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and own payment-related projects independently, including discovery, implementation, and coordination with Product and Engineering teams.&lt;br&gt;Work hands on with core payment systems and schemes, including TARGET, SWIFT, SEPA, and SEPA Instant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop test concepts and execute user acceptance testing (UAT) for payment-related changes and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor, investigate payment incidents, ensuring timely root-cause analysis and remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct technical and regulatory research and monitoring on e.g., SWIFT, Bundesbank, EPC and communicate relevant changes and impacts to internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the scope of Payment Operations in &amp;nbsp;internal and external working groups, technical showcases, and annual industry tests (e.g., Bundesbank, SWIFT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert for special services (e.g., SWIFT or Bundesbank), including maintaining and owning Payments-related Confluence documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous process optimization and automation (e.g., reporting, ticket creation) to improve operational efficiency and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Business Administration, Engineering, Finance, Economics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in payments, operations, business analysis, or project management, ideally within fintech, banking, or a fast-paced technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of European payment infrastructures and schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with SQL and data analytics tools (e.g., Looker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in process optimization, project delivery, and stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, solution-oriented approach to incident management and process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional English speaking skills and at least B2 German speaking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The ideal candidate will be based in Germany and should be willing and able to travel across Europe for additional client engagements as needed.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;is the leading Commerce Media OS, powering over $12B in advertising spend across 100+ global retail media networks including Amazon, Walmart, Target, Kroger, Instacart, Criteo, and&amp;nbsp;CitrusAd. Powered by industry-leading AI and real-time data,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;enables over 70,000 brands and agencies to maximize advertising performance, drive incrementality, and expand reach across the commerce universe from a single mission control. As of 2025,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;powers 12% of total retail media ad spend worldwide excluding China. Combined with Helium 10’s SMB solutions,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;delivers the industry’s most comprehensive platform for businesses of all sizes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;and Helium 10, great careers&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;just happen —&amp;nbsp;they’re&amp;nbsp;built. Here,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;rise as an industry leader, push the boundaries of innovation, own your journey, and thrive as part of an inclusive global community&amp;nbsp;that’s&amp;nbsp;redefining the future of commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the&amp;nbsp;Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As an Account Manager, Enterprise Partnerships at&amp;nbsp;Pacvue, you will support the day-to-day management of client accounts across a portfolio of European agency clients, primarily independent&amp;nbsp;Amazon&amp;nbsp;and ecommerce agencies, and ecommerce brands&amp;nbsp;with growing exposure to enterprise-level retailers such as Amazon and other regional platforms. This role will involve working closely with internal team members and client stakeholders across multiple European markets to help execute partnership plans, ensuring clients achieve success through our platform while supporting overall revenue goals for&amp;nbsp;Pacvue.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be expected to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;your analytical skills, communication abilities, and insights to&amp;nbsp;assist&amp;nbsp;with client outcomes and support ongoing account activities in a dynamic, fast-growing international environment, and using data to tell the story.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
